      {
        "id": 2473140625,
        "content": "The problem is that our preview deployments redirect us to the production portal and so the auth is not valid and we cannot actually test the deployment.\r\nWe use `Supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth` to \"Login via GitHub\". We can optionally pass a `redirectTo` in the options which may resolve this issue. Either generally redirecting back to the same URL it came from or strictly `work.ubq.fi` and a wildcard to match our preview deployment URLs.\r\nI think it would be safer to restrict.",
