        "id": 2396087012,
        "content": "@zugdev The issue is that cloudflare [preview deployment](https://github.com/ubiquity/work.ubq.fi/pull/107#issuecomment-2395824462) URLs redirect to `work.ubq.fi` after github oauth instead of the preview URL.\r\nExample:\r\n1. Open https://11352a0e.devpool-directory-ui.pages.dev/\r\n2. Login with github\r\n3. You'll be redirected to `work.ubq.fi` while the expected redirect URL is https://11352a0e.devpool-directory-ui.pages.dev/\r\nCan't we simply use:\r\n```js\r\n  const { error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({\r\n    provider: \"github\",\r\n    options: {\r\n      scopes,\r\n      redirectTo: window.location.origin,\r\n    },\r\n  });\r\n```",
